Error [jet.DeferLeavesItsBlock]: `break` can't leave a `defer` body
  --> tests/ui/defer_break.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |             break
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: A `defer` body runs as its block ends, after the block's own exit was chosen, so it can't choose another.
 Fix: Take the `break` out of the `defer` body and choose the exit in the block itself.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0509
